---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import myPhoto from "../assets/poto.png"
---

<section class="animate">
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-black/10 dark:border-white/15">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white">About Me</h2>
      <Image
        src={myPhoto}
        alt="Anggun Caksono"
        width={44}
        height={44}
        class="rounded-full border border-black/10 dark:border-white/20"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-3 text-black/80 dark:text-white/85">
      <p>
        I am an Informatics Engineering student, full-stack software developer, and Google Cloud Arcade Fasilitator based in Indonesia. As a Cloud Computing alumnus of Bangkit Academy 2024 (led by Google, GoTo, &amp; Traveloka), I completed the Entrepreneur Track and received incubation funding for MIRA — a radiology PACS technology initiative on GCP.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a Google Cloud Arcade Fasilitator, I help participants work through hands-on GCP labs — troubleshooting lab issues, guiding console navigation, and supporting them to complete challenges and unlock milestones across compute, storage, networking, and machine learning services.
      </p>
      <p>
        My core focus spans full-stack web engineering (Astro, TypeScript, Node.js, Go), cloud infrastructure setup (GCP, AWS, Firebase), and machine learning applications (TensorFlow, Scikit-learn via IDCamp 2024 ML Track).
      </p>
      <p class="font-medium text-black dark:text-white pt-1">
        Currently available for full-stack engineering, cloud architecture, and freelance project opportunities.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
